{"version":"1","id":"amplication","handle":"amplication","name":"Amplication","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/81a4f43fc0b84e55b9f61cbae4ec745a","description":null,"is_squad":false,"x":-7.4258,"y":4.912,"cluster_id":2,"posts_collected":65,"newest_post_at":"2025-02-13T16:44:14.252Z","oldest_post_at":"2022-12-23T06:39:39.416Z","features":{"hype_score":0.015385,"listicle_ratio":0.046154,"question_ratio":0.046154,"avg_read_time":7.276923,"summary_length_avg":339.138462,"title_length_avg":55.292308,"title_length_var":307.006864,"tag_entropy":3.789884,"tag_diversity":1.476923,"top_tag_share":0.076923,"avg_upvotes":48.907692,"median_upvotes":35.0,"avg_comments":3.076923,"comment_to_upvote_ratio":0.063208,"zero_engagement_share":0.015385,"viral_share":0.123077,"posts_per_week":0.653443,"non_article_ratio":0.0,"author_present_share":0.415385,"recency_skew":0.015625},"view_coords":{"engagement_style":[9.6471,5.9559],"cadence_depth":[-2.75,2.8676],"hype_variety":[3.4559,5.9559],"title_style":[5.2206,7.9853]},"top_tags":[["backend",50],["amplication",38],["nodejs",23],["database",21],["microservices",19],["github",12],["rest-api",11],["prisma",11]],"sample_titles":{"representative":["The Complete Microservices Guide","Top 6 ORMs for Modern Node.js App Development","Node.js Development: All You Need to Know"],"outlier":["Code Your Way to Seals: Rapid Development with Amplication and GitHub Copilot for a Seal of the Day"]},"recent_posts":[{"id":"hwAWM4JRp","title":"Accelerating DevOps Excellence with DORA Metrics and Amplication","url":"https://amplication.com/blog/accelerating-devops-excellence-with-dora-metrics-and-amplication","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/accelerating-devops-excellence-with-dora-metrics-and-amplication-hwawm4jrp","summary":"DORA metrics, comprising Deployment Frequency, Lead Time for Changes, Change Failure Rate, and Mean Time to Recovery, offer data-driven insights into software delivery performance. These metrics help engineering teams balance speed and stability, aiding continuous improvement. Amplication accelerates development and deployment by automating code generation and integrating with CI/CD tools, enhancing DORA metrics significantly. The emphasis is on real value and operational excellence rather than compliance.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/8e6280541178237320971c796adcd49e?_a=AQAEuj9","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2025-02-13T16:44:14.252Z"},{"id":"Cw7ou5CeJ","title":"Streamlining Backend Development: Reducing Technical Debt and Preventing Template Drift","url":"https://amplication.com/blog/eliminating-template-drift-and-reducing-technical-debt-in-backend-development","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/streamlining-backend-development-reducing-technical-debt-and-preventing-template-drift-cw7ou5cej","summary":"Internal Developer Platforms (IDPs) like Backstage, Port, Spotify Portal, and Cortex help streamline workflows and reduce technical debt by standardizing service creation. However, they often fail to maintain alignment with evolving standards, leading to template drift and increased technical debt. Amplication offers a proactive solution with live templates, AI-powered code generation, and automatic maintenance to ensure consistency and compliance. It integrates seamlessly with existing IDPs or can be used as a standalone platform to keep services up-to-date, reducing the manual effort associated with maintaining standards.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/61f2d59ff1fad73fb2e89f8f1c4c3f68?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":21,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-10-28T11:25:54.313Z"},{"id":"2au9pd9aF","title":"Backend Development with AI-Powered .NET Code Generation","url":"https://amplication.com/blog/ai-powered-dotnet-backend-development","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/backend-development-with-ai-powered-net-code-generation-2au9pd9af","summary":"Amplication has expanded its backend development platform to support full AI-powered .NET code generation. This solution helps developers handle and update legacy code, integrate with Microsoft tools, meet compliance and security standards, and adhere to enterprise best practices. It offers features such as AI-powered code generation, configurable data models, CRUD and custom APIs generation, scalable architecture, authentication and authorization support, and integration with popular tools and services.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/3e7dc9c1b45291e0b0c62753bd753478?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":38,"num_comments":3,"created_at":"2024-06-17T09:30:00.000Z"},{"id":"zZYj0UYGU","title":"Amplication AI & Jovu: Leading AI-Powered Code Generation","url":"https://amplication.com/blog/amplication-ai-the-future-of-ai-code-generation","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/amplication-ai-jovu-leading-ai-powered-code-generation-zzyj0uygu","summary":"Amplication AI is a future code generation tool powered by Jovu, an AI assistant that creates production-ready backend code. Jovu offers tailored recommendations, creates entities and APIs, and generates code with predictable output. It is capable of managing complexity in services and assisting in implementing custom business logic.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/8c17d52b830101f595a869f3752fe02e?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":7,"num_comments":3,"created_at":"2024-05-15T06:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"Q94V2LTuq","title":"Why Developers Resist Low-Code Solutions: Insights & Solutions","url":"https://amplication.com/blog/decoding-the-mystery-why-your-developers-give-low-code-solutions-the-cold-shoulder","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/why-developers-resist-low-code-solutions-insights-solutions-q94v2ltuq","summary":"Discover why developers resist low-code solutions and their need for seamless integration, customization, and freedom from vendor lock-in.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/72648a08fde54804641525f4e720141b?_a=AQAEuiZ","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-05-06T06:19:00.000Z"},{"id":"8LOTCeD2g","title":"How To Deploy Backend Services with AWS and Amplication: A Comprehensive Guide","url":"https://amplication.com/blog/how-to-deploy-backend-services-with-aws-and-amplication-a-comprehensive-guide","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-to-deploy-backend-services-with-aws-and-amplication-a-comprehensive-guide-8lotced2g","summary":"Learn how to deploy backend services with Amplication and AWS. Generate a production-ready backend service with Amplication and seamlessly deploy it to AWS cloud. Use AWS services like ECS, ECR, RDS, and S3 for hosting and managing applications.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/740293d94ae6aefff73b4815b8aec2be?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-04-22T08:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"HzvN7xiJ0","title":"Amplication's New Custom Types & Actions for Enhanced Backend Flexibility","url":"https://amplication.com/blog/effortless-api-creation-and-management-custom-types-and-actions","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/amplication-s-new-custom-types-actions-for-enhanced-backend-flexibility-hzvn7xij0","summary":"Amplication introduces Custom Types & Actions, providing flexibility and control over backend services. Users can generate production-ready code, manage APIs, and ensure uniformity. Custom DTO creation and seamless API management streamline workflows. Granular control allows for adapting application behavior.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/887b3f32f3223eedfeea2a73bf3401a4?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":3,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-04-15T08:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"kOiF4XFCX","title":"Breaking The Monolith- Simplifying the Shift to Microservices","url":"https://amplication.com/blog/breaking-the-monolith-simplifying-the-shift-to-microservices","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/breaking-the-monolith--simplifying-the-shift-to-microservices-koif4xfcx","summary":"Amplication has announced the beta release of Break The Monolith, a feature that simplifies the shift to microservices. It offers a smooth pathway to transform monolithic systems into modular microservice architectures. Break The Monolith consists of a dynamic interface for designing microservice architecture and an AI Helper for suggesting optimal designs. The feature also includes an overview and redesign mode, intelligent AI suggestions, and automatic code generation.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/baf4e1330a94f199c8e1cb2dbd23aad9?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":22,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-03-06T13:13:00.000Z"},{"id":"IKmqbGCRD","title":"Creating a Restaurant Finder Application Using ReactJS and Amplication","url":"https://amplication.com/blog/creating-a-restaurant-finder-full-stack-web-application-using-reactjs-and-amplication","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/creating-a-restaurant-finder-application-using-reactjs-and-amplication-ikmqbgcrd","summary":"This tutorial guides you through building a restaurant finder application using ReactJS and Amplication. It covers creating the backend using Amplication and connecting it to the frontend built in ReactJS.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/477a244d2e297b5651cb3949818de671?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":21,"num_comments":3,"created_at":"2024-01-15T05:54:00.000Z"},{"id":"617zUZIsN","title":"Extending GitOps: Effortless Continuous Integration and Deployment on Kubernetes","url":"https://amplication.com/blog/extending-gitops-effortless-continuous-integration-and-deployment-on-kubernetes","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/extending-gitops-effortless-continuous-integration-and-deployment-on-kubernetes-617zuzisn","summary":"Learn h